---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Poems — Princess" activeTab="poems">
<div class="page">
  <div class="section" style="padding-top:48px">
    <p class="section-label">Words</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">Poems</h1>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <div class="poems-list">
      <div class="poem-card frost-card">
        <p class="poem-title">Versailles</p>
        <p class="poem-meta">21st July, 26 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 1 min read</p>
        <p class="poem-body">
          Love that once bloomed<br/>
          in the gardens of Versailles,<br/>
          filled with hope,<br/>
          like violets in the gentle breeze,<br/>
          swaying to the sweet music of our gaiety,<br/>
          beneath the golden canopy, where whispers dance,<br/>
          beautiful, were those words uttered,<br/>
          promises made to be held onto forever,<br/>
          but seasons soon turned into winter,<br/>
          your sweet smile turned sinister,<br/>
          as you caged me in Bastille,<br/>
          my little heart still held onto what could have been.<br/><br/>
          shadows of gloom fell where light once played.<br/>
          as the heavenly ambers of warmth consumed me,<br/>
          our little snow globe played it's bitter sweet melody<br/>
          echoes of our laughter slowly fade<br/>
          screams of epiphany rings through halls<br/>
          shattering castles of dreams we once made.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>

<style>
.poems-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
.poem-card { padding: 32px 32px 28px; }
.poem-title {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.poem-meta {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  color: var(--text-faint);
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.poem-body {
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 1.08rem;
  line-height: 2;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}
</style>
